[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4953219993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121252#issuecomment-4953219993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121252","id":4953219993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJzwjmQ","user":{"login":"BrotherShort","id":129957860,"node_id":"U_kgDOB77_5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129957860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort","html_url":"https://github.com/BrotherShort","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-12T23:33:41Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T23:33:41Z","body":"Do you use a custom theme for editor?\n\n<img width=\"896\" height=\"726\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/65d56d24-674c-4c44-83e3-835b8a48e8c3\" />\n\nIs the `LineEdit`'s back color is transparent in the custom theme?\n\nIf so, you will get this result.\n\n<img width=\"595\" height=\"193\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07b5a0cc-a431-40c5-aade-3d49a17ef459\" />\n\nWhen you click `x` `y` values to enter edit mode, what essentially happens is that a `LineEdit` node shows and covers the control. If `LineEdit`'s back color is transparent, covered text will appear.","aut